                                handwriting ends; <ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per46" n="Smith, Joseph, Jr.">JS</ref> begins.</note>the <ref pm:link-pointer-type="topic" target="x4091" n="Keys">Kees</ref> of
                            the Kingdom of God <lb/>confered upon him<note xml:id="JSPPH1_d1e1386" pm:link-target-type="text" type="editorial-footnote">See Matthew
