                                81:2].</note> and the continuation of the <lb/>blessings of God to
                            him &amp;c——</p> <p xml:id="JSPPH1_d1e1407" rend="indent">I was born in the town of <placeName>Charon <supplied resp="WAITENN">Sharon</supplied></placeName> in the <add resp="Nathan Waite" hand="per46">State</add> of Vermont <lb/>North
                            America on the <date when-iso="1805-12-23">twenty third day of December
