                                1:1].</note> who spared no pains <lb/>to instruct<add resp="WAITENN">ing</add> me in <add resp="WAITENN">the</add> christian
                                religion<supplied resp="Nathan Waite">.</supplied> at the age of
                            <lb/>about ten years my Father <ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per58" n="Joseph Smith Sr.">Joseph Smith Seignior</ref>
