                            life <add resp="Nathan Waite">behold</add> the world <lb/>lieth in sin
                                <del resp="Conversion">and</del> at this time and none doeth good no
                            <lb/>not one they have turned asside from the gospel and <lb/>keep not
                                <add resp="Nathan Waite">my</add> commandments they draw near to me
